	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 『機動戦士ガンダムSEED』外伝「ガンダムSEEDアストレイ」より、「天空の宣言」の守神「ゴールドフレーム 天ミナ」がRGに降臨！",
			"• 背部の「マガノイクタチ」には、独自の展開・伸縮機構を備えた新規ギミックを搭載！",
			"• 実機の外装部分の質感の違いを、成形色と素材の使い分けによりリアルに再現！",
			"• 1/144で初立体化となる、攻防一体の槍状の武器「オキツノカガミ」は、刃とビームシールドがクリアパーツで再現されているほか、多彩な武装も付属する。"
		],
		"en": [
			"• From the \"MOBILE SUIT GUNDAM SEED\" Gaiden \"GUNDAM SEED Astray\", the guardian god of \"Declaration of the Sky\" \"Gold Flame Tenmina\" descends on RG!",
			"• The \"Magano Ikutachi\" on the back is equipped with a new gimmick with a unique deployment and telescopic mechanism!",
			"• The difference in the texture of the exterior part of the actual machine is realistically reproduced by using different molding colors and materials!",
			"• The \"Okitsu no Kagami\", a spear-shaped weapon that integrates offense and defense, which will be three-dimensional for the first time on 1/144, comes with a blade and beam shield reproduced with clear parts, as well as a variety of weapons."
		]
	},
